return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T19:55:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T19:55:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Ń tẹ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí jáde ní gbogbo èdè tí ẹ bá yàn, lórí àwọn àdírẹ́sì wẹ́ẹ̀bù tirẹ̀, pẹ̀lú àwọn slug tí a túmọ̀, metadata, àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn, àwọn ọjà WooCommerce, hreflang, àwọn máàpù ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan àti llms.txt. Ṣe ìtúmọ̀ pẹ̀lú ètò Zinn Digital® yín tàbí pẹ̀lú kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùpèsè ti ara yín.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fipamọ́. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọ́pò rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣẹ àtòjọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣàlẹ́kà àtòkọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹ̀mọ́ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Ṣafikun ila kan','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ìlà yìí kúrò','Remove'=>'Yọ kúrò','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Copied'=>'A ti dàkọ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo afikun Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò sí ìsopọ̀ kankan tí a nílò fún àfikún yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O kò ní àṣẹ láti yí àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí padà.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn abala ètò','Support'=>'Ìtìlẹ́yìn','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn àyípadà','Tools'=>'Àwọn Irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Gbe awọn eto jade','Reset to defaults'=>'Tunto si ti aiyipada','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò dá gbogbo ètò tí ó wà lórí plugin yìí padà sí ti àkọ́kọ́. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Awọn iwadii aisan fun atilẹyin','Import a settings file'=>'Kó fáìlì ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Kó wọlé','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a firanṣẹ si oke ko ni awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle, awọn ami tabi awọn bọtini API rara — iwọ yoo nilo lati tẹ wọn sii lẹẹkansi lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí ti padà sí àkọ́kọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀.','Done.'=>'Ti parí.','That action is not available.'=>'Igbese yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Kò le ka faili yẹn. Yan faili awọn eto ti a gbejade lati inu ohun-itanna Zinn® kan.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ àtìgbejáde àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kì í ṣe ìmúkúrò àwọn ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ fáìlì yẹn látinú àfikún míràn (%s), nítorí náà mímú wọlé síbí yóò fi àwọn ètò tí àfikún yìí kò yé pamọ́.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'A ti gbe ètò %d wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API kì í wà nínú ìgbéjade rárá, nítorí náà tún wọn tẹ̀ sii.','Translate'=>'Túmọ̀','Manual overrides'=>'Awọn ifagilee afọwọṣe','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Àwọn maapu ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù àti àwọn URL','General'=>'Gbogbogbò','Who pays for the translation'=>'Ta ló ń sanwó fún ìyípadà èdè','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Boya ètò Zinn Digital® rẹ, tàbí kókó API ti ara rẹ. Kò sí ipele ọ̀fẹ́ — ẹnìkan ń sanwó fún olùpèsè fún ọ̀rọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Ètò Zinn Digital® mi','My own provider key'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùpèsè tèmi fúnra mi','Site ID'=>'ID Ojúlé Wẹ́ẹ̀bù','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Lati orí pẹpẹ ìṣàkóso Zinn Digital® rẹ, lórí táàbù Translation ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','Site token'=>'Àmì ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','An API key from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on its API keys page. Give it the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions.'=>'Kókó API kan láti orí pátákó ìdarí Zinn Digital® rẹ, lórí ojú-ewé àwọn kókó API rẹ̀. Fún un ní àwọn àṣẹ sites.view àti sites.translation.manage.','Provider'=>'Olùpèsè','API key'=>'Kókórọ́ API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ, tí olùpèsè fún ọ ní owó rẹ̀. A tọ́jú rẹ̀ sí orí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, a sì ń fi ránṣẹ́ sí wọn nìkan.','Model'=>'Awoṣe','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofo fun awoṣe ti o dinwo julọ ti o ṣe iṣẹ naa daradara.','This site is written in'=>'A kọ aaye yii ni','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti lo èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù láti inú àwọn ètò WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Àwọn èdè láti tẹ̀jáde','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Ọkọọkan n gba awọn adirẹsi wẹẹbu tirẹ ati maapu aaye tirẹ. Ṣe atẹjade awọn ede ti o fẹ ki a ṣe atọka wọn nikan.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Túmọ̀ lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ nígbà tí mo bá tẹ̀jáde tàbí ṣe àtúnṣe','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Ṣiṣatunkọ oju-iwe kan yoo samisi awọn itumọ rẹ bi eyiti ko ti lo mọ ti a o si tun wọn ṣe ni abẹlẹ. Ṣiṣatunkọ laisi yiyipada eyikeyi awọn ọrọ ko na ohunkohun.','What gets translated'=>'Kí ló ń jẹ́ títumọ̀','Post types'=>'Àwọn irú ìfìwéranṣẹ́','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Ṣe afikun itumọ awọn adirẹsi wẹẹbu naa','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Awọn alejo Faranse gba /fr/a-propos/ dipo /fr/about/. Adirẹsi ti a ko tumọ tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ ati ṣe atunṣe, nitorinaa ko si ohun ti a ṣe atọka ti o bajẹ.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Ṣe itumọ awọn akọle SEO, awọn apejuwe ati ọrọ alt aworan','Translate categories and tags'=>'Ṣe itumọ awọn ẹka ati awọn aami','Translate navigation menus'=>'Ṣe itumọ awọn akojọ aṣayan lilọ kiri','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Ṣe itumọ awọn ọja ati awọn abuda WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Awọn apejuwe kukuru, awọn akọsilẹ rira, awọn aami abuda ati awọn apejuwe orisirisi. Awọn idiyele, awọn SKU ati awọn iye aṣayan ti o fipamọ ko ni fọwọkan lailai.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ṣafikun awọn aami hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Ó ń sọ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣàwárí pé ojú-ìwé kan náà ni àwọn ojú-ìwé wọ̀nyí ní àwọn èdè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀. Fi èyí sí títàn àyàfi tí ohun-ìfidára-mọ́ miiran bá ti ń ṣe é tẹ́lẹ̀.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Ṣe atẹjade maapu aaye fun ede kọọkan','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Ṣe atẹjade llms.txt fun ede kọọkan','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Maapu ọrọ lasan ti aaye naa ti awọn ẹrọ idahun AI n ka. Nigbagbogbo wọn ko le ṣiṣẹ JavaScript ati pe wọn le ma gba maapu aaye rara.','Language switcher'=>'Olùyípadà èdè','Style'=>'Àkàwé','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀, ààyè àti àwọn igun wà lórí táàbù Ìṣelédídára. Fi síbẹ̀ pẹ̀lú búlọ́ọ̀kì náà, kóòdù kúkúrú [zinn_language_switcher], tàbí mẹ́nù kan.','Show only these languages'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn ede wọnyi nikan','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ lásán láti fi gbogbo èdè tí o tẹ̀jáde hàn.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Darúkọ èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan ní èdè tirẹ̀','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch dipo German. Ẹnikan ti ko le ka oju-iwe lọwọlọwọ ko le ka "German" pẹlu.','Show flags'=>'Fi àwọn àmì àsíá hàn','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'A pa á gẹ́gẹ́ bí àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀: èdè kì í ṣe orílẹ̀-èdè kan, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni Lárúbáwá àti Sípáníìṣì kò ní àsíá kan ṣoṣo tí kò yọ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùsọ̀rọ̀ wọn sílẹ̀.','Include the language being read'=>'Pẹlu èdè tí a ń kà','Include the original language'=>'Fi èdè àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kún un','Add it to this menu'=>'Fi kun akojọ aṣayan yii','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Kiki akojọ aṣayan ti o ba sọ lorukọ nibi. Ko si ohun ti a fi kun akojọ aṣayan miiran lori aaye naa.','Accent'=>'Ami','Background'=>'Abẹlẹ','Text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Corner radius'=>'Ìwọ̀n igun','Spacing'=>'Ààyè','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Maa ṣe fi kún akojọ aṣayan kan','none'=>'kò sí','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard, under "Shown to visitors". This site checks it every hour. Publishing now: %s.'=>'Lori ètò Zinn Digital® kan o yan awọn ede lati tẹjade lori taabu Itumọ aaye yii ninu dasibodu rẹ, labẹ "Ti o han si awọn alejo". Aaye yii n ṣayẹwo rẹ ni gbogbo wakati. Titẹjade ni bayi: %s.','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard. This site has not read that choice yet, so it is still publishing: %s. Check the Site ID and token above.'=>'Lori ètò Zinn Digital® o yan awọn ede lati tẹjade lori taabu Translation ti aaye yii ninu dasibodu rẹ. Aaye yii ko tii ka yiyan yẹn, nitorinaa o ṣi n tẹjade: %s. Ṣayẹwo ID Aaye ati àmì loke.','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Ṣatunkọ itumọ eyikeyi nibi. Itumọ ti a ṣatunkọ ni a tọju gẹgẹ bi o ti kọ ọ, a kii si kọ sori rẹ nigba ti a ba tun oju-iwe naa tumọ.','Every language'=>'Gbogbo èdè','Search translations'=>'Ṣawari awọn itumọ','Filter'=>'Ṣẹ́','Content'=>'Àkóónú','Language'=>'Èdè','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Status'=>'Ipo','Save'=>'Fipamọ́','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'A kò tíì túmọ̀ ohunkóhun síbẹ̀. Tẹ èdè kan jáde bẹ́ẹ̀ ni ìtúmọ̀ yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní abẹ́lẹ̀.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì wọ̀nyí wà láàyè. Ṣí èyíkéyìí nínú wọn láti yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò, kí o sì fi atọ́ka maapu aaye ránṣẹ́ sí Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'A kò fún ọ láàyè láti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn ìtumọ̀ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Àtúnṣe látọwọ́ rẹ — pa mọ́','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Orisun ti yipada — a o tun ṣe','Up to date'=>'Ti di báyìí mú','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ̀','Connecting…'=>'Ń sopọ̀…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti so pọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n nǹkan kan nílò àfiyèsí','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí àkópọ̀ ti ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè yẹ èyí wò','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àfikún yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Ẹ fi ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ kí a sì yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò.','Connection status'=>'Ipò ìsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A ṣayẹwo rẹ̀ kẹhin ni %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí nínú táàbù tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èyí ránṣẹ́ sí ẹ̀ka ìrànlọ́wọ́ Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a óò firanṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun kankan tí a fi pamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìwọlé, àwọn tókìnì àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API yín kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ sí àtẹ-ìkọ̀wé','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ijabọ yii ranṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A máa ṣí tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì ìtìlẹ́yìn fún yín, a sì máa fèsì nípasẹ̀ e-mail. Tí ẹ kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, ẹ da kọ láti òkè kí ẹ sì lẹ̀ ẹ́ sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì fúnra yín.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ Zinn Digital® láti orí olupin yìí (%s). Ṣe ẹ̀dà ìròyìn tó wà lókè yìí kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́ẹ̀tì dípò rẹ̀ — kò sí ohun tí ó bàjẹ́ nínú àwọn ètò rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Ti firanṣẹ. Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọpọlọpọ awọn ijabọ ranṣẹ laarin igba diẹ. Duro fun iṣẹju diẹ ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi — awọn ti iṣaaju ti de.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le gba ìròyìn náà wọlé ní báyìí — láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa ni, kì í ṣe tìrẹ. Tún gbìyànjú lẹ́yìn ìgbà díẹ̀, tàbí kí o da ìròyìn tó wà lókè yìí kọ sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ijabọ naa (HTTP %d). Da ẹkọ rẹ loke ki o ṣii tiketi kan, nipa sọ nọmba yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà aṣàmúlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Tọ́jú èyí','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àwòkọ afẹ́yìntì ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkápá ati awọn ifibọ ọna asopọ, pẹlu owo ti a tọju lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun ìgbésí-ayé wọn','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́ freelance àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn akọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣètò àwòrán, àwọn olùgbéejáde àti àwọn akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ àkànṣe síbẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'A kọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ó ṣì wúlò tí ó sì ní àyè sí ìyípadà èdè, lẹ́yìn náà tún fi pamọ́.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Olupese kọ nitori isanwo tabi iye ti a pin. Ko si ohun ti a tumọ. Ṣayẹwo iye to ku ati awọn opin lori akọọlẹ rẹ pẹlu wọn.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Olupese iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀ ń ní ìṣòro kan ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ tiwọn. Kò sí ohun tí a túmọ̀ tàbí gbà owó rẹ̀, yóò sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìgbìyànjú tí ń bọ̀.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìtúmọ̀ náà kùnà, a kò sì le sọ ìdí rẹ̀. A kò fi ohunkóhun pamọ́.','Sitemap index'=>'Ìtọ́ka maapu aaye','%s sitemap'=>'Maapu aaye ayelujara %s','LLM content map'=>'Maapu akoonu LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'Maapu akoonu LLM ti %s','Languages published'=>'Àwọn èdè tí a tẹ̀jáde','Site language'=>'Èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','SEO plugin'=>'Púlọ́ọ̀gì SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí olùpèsè ìyípadà èdè kankan tí a gbé kalẹ̀.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Lẹ lẹ́tà àṣẹ API kan láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè tí ẹ yàn, tàbí kí ẹ so ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà mọ́ àkọọ́lẹ̀ Zinn Digital® kan, ìtúmọ̀ yóò sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní ìpele tí ń bọ̀.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Títúmọ̀ pẹ̀lú kọ́kọ́rọ́ %s ti ara yín.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ si akọọlẹ Zinn Digital® kan, eyiti ko si nkan — olupese rẹ n gba owo lọwọ rẹ taara.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Kò tíì so pọ̀ mọ́ Zinn Digital®.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ṣafikun ID ati aami aaye yii lati inu dasibodu Zinn Digital® rẹ, tabi yipada si kọkọrọ olupese ti ara rẹ lati ṣiṣẹ laisi akọọlẹ kan.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ti sopọ mọ Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Olùpèsè ìyípadà èdè ń ní ìṣòro kan.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'A da ìtúmọ̀ dúró — olùpèsè rẹ nílò àfiyèsí.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'A kò tí ì ṣètò ìyípadà èdè.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Nǹkan kan kò lọ déédéé láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa.','Check their status page'=>'Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn','Fix this on your account'=>'Ṣe atunṣe eyi lori akọọlẹ rẹ','Style preset'=>'Ètò àkànṣe àṣà','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ojúàmì ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kan. Ohun kòhun tó wà nísàlẹ̀ ń tẹ̀ ẹ́ mọ́lẹ̀.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo àwọn àwọ̀ àti ìwọ̀n ti ara mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ni pipa ati pe a o lo eto ti a ti ṣe tẹlẹ gẹgẹ bi o ti wa.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Olùyí èdè Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Gba awọn alejo laaye lati ka oju-iwe yii ni ede miiran.','Title'=>'Àkọlé','Use the plugin setting'=>'Lo ètò àfikún náà','Dropdown'=>'Akojọ aṣayan ti o lọ silẹ','Inline list'=>'Àkójọ inú-ìlà','Pills'=>'Awọn egbogi','Minimal text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ díẹ̀','Flags and names'=>'Àwọn àsíá àti orúkọ','Stacked list'=>'Àtòjọ tí a tò le ara wọn','Choose a language'=>'Yan èdè kan','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkíyèsí àtẹ̀jáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣàfikún Zinn® kò pèsè ọ̀nà ìgbàsílẹ̀ fún ìṣàfikún yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè dé orí pèpéle Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìgbà tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùn nínú àyẹ̀wò àìlábùkù rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'A kò fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ API DeepL kankan pamọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi ṣe ìyípadà èdè.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL kò ṣe ìtúmọ̀ sí %s. Yan Google Gemini tàbí OpenAI fún èdè yìí, tàbí kí o so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà pọ̀ mọ́ Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'A kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ DeepL. Kò sí ohun tí a túmọ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni a kò gba owó kankan; yóò tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìgbìyànjú tí ń bọ̀.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Koota awọn lẹta DeepL rẹ ti tán fun sáà yii. Itumọ yoo tẹsiwaju nigbati o ba tun bẹrẹ, tabi nigbati o ba mu iye to lopin pọ si lori akọọlẹ DeepL rẹ.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL dáhùn pẹ̀lú ohun kan tí a kò lè kà. Kò sí ohun tí a fipamọ́.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Kò sí bọ́tìnì Google Gemini API tí a fipamọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi ṣe ìyípadà èdè.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Kò lè dé ọ̀dọ̀ Google Gemini. Kò sí ohun tí a túmọ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a kò gba owó kankan; yóò tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìgbà mìíràn.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Kò sí kókórọ́ OpenAI API tí a fipamọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi ṣe ìyípadà èdè.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'A kò le rí OpenAI gbà. A kò ṣe ìtúmọ̀ ohun kankan bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a kò gba owó kankan; yóò tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìgbìyànjú tó kàn.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ mọ Zinn Digital®, nitorinaa ko si ohun ti a le gba. Fi ID Aye ati àmì sii, tabi yipada si kọkọrọ olupese tirẹ.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ mọ Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti dé ọ̀dọ̀ Zinn Digital®. Kò sí ohun tí a fi ránṣẹ́; yóò tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní ìgbà tí ó kàn.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'A da ìtúmọ̀ dúró lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ náà wà ní báyìí lórí pátákó ìdarí Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. It must be an API key with the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions — create one on the API keys page of your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® kọ àmì ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Ó gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API pẹ̀lú àwọn àṣẹ sites.view àti sites.translation.manage — ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan lórí ojú-ewé àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API ti pátákó ìdarí rẹ.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'A kò le ráàyè sí Zinn Digital®. Ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yín yóò máa bá a lọ láti pèsè àwọn ìyédèpadà tó ti ní tẹ́lẹ̀.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® dáhùn pẹ̀lú ohun kan tí a kò lè kà. Ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ ń tẹ̀síwájú láti pèsè àwọn ìyípadà èdè tí ó ní tẹ́lẹ̀.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'A kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ Zinn Digital®. Ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ ń tẹ̀síwájú láti tẹ àwọn èdè tí ó ti ní tẹ́lẹ̀ jáde.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® dáhùn pẹ̀lú nǹkan tí a kò le kà. Ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yín ń tẹ̀síwájú láti tẹ àwọn èdè tí ó ti ní tẹ́lẹ̀ jáde.']];